rDate\":\"2006-10-08\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Popping Cherry\",\"overview\":\"Dexter's on the trail of a recently released murderer who plans to kill again when he's sidetracked by The Ice Truck Killer's latest crime - a cut-up hooker found in a hockey ice rink.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8yzGYMSNL0v3ke7ZhMVwLQ1EJjU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":125,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-15\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Let's Give the Boy a Hand\",\"overview\":\"The Ice Truck Killer begins leaving body parts from his victims at sites that relate to memories from Dexter's childhood, forcing him to confront his dark personal history.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e6ZiRNeHCFuXRJdwoQJORA9q9nl.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":118,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-22\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Love American Style\",\"overview\":\"The Homicide Division is buzzing after the Ice Truck Killer's latest victim is found mutilated but alive, while Dexter gets in over his head when he stalks a murderous human trafficker.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fpLBlBrhOSqUHXDEiiTRh9k7zPj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"voteCount\":107,\"airDate\":\"2006-10-29\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Return to Sender\",\"overview\":\"The Ice Truck Killer leaves Dexter a surprise at the scene of one of Dexter's kills, placing him firmly in the cross hairs of his own Homicide Division colleagues.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fg5uVRanMihJ184Za4UqwYjumBE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":112,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-05\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Circle of Friends\",\"overview\":\"The Ice Truck Killer is finally identified, but something about the suspect doesn't sit right with Dexter, who must also deal with the menacing return of Rita's paroled ex-husband.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gpqFeUvCSMNWFd4IJbtY2FH6noD.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":104,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-12\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Shrink Wrap\",\"overview\":\"The strange suicide of a powerful woman leads Dexter to suspect her shrink of murder, but he gets a shock when a visit to the suspect opens up dark secrets from Dexter's past.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dVgkD1GnbZWrDballxqiGE3Yh3H.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":109,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-19\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Father Knows Best\",\"overview\":\"Dexter is joined by Rita, Debra and Rudy for a weekend away when he learns that his biological father, whom he was told died thirty years ago, has just recently passed away and left him everything he owned, including his house.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8IUBoErgGbboihLAuPDhN5IsO2s.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"voteCount\":104,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-26\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Seeing Red\",\"overview\":\"When Dexter is sent to investigate a bloody crime scene, deeply suppressed memories from his childhood begin to resurface.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6USM3E9TrAGfUk5mrBqhIFZ8CZ9.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":107,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-03\",\"runtime\":56},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Truth Be Told\",\"overview\":\"The Ice Truck Killer takes extreme measures, forcing Dexter into a trap that will forever change his life, while Doakes begins to harbor suspicions about Dexter's odd behavior.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u1zo83Ak8pOC8q1znDyrBxESYe3.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"voteCount\":109,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-10\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Born Free\",\"overview\":\"Dexter follows the clues left for him by The Ice Truck Killer, while Paul tries to convince Rita that Dexter is dangerous.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ObZDLK3f7BucdgtmAlHZRYN3IB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.9,\"voteCount\":115,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-17\",\"runtime\":56}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2006-10-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}